flowchart TD
    A([Teacher starts]) --> B[/Select section and grading period/]
    B --> C[Enter scores, remarks, and optional attendance]
    C --> D{Save draft or submit?}
    D -- Draft --> E[(Save nt_class_records)]
    D -- Submit --> F{Completion check?}
    F -- Actual: none --> G[Build snapshot, even when all scores are blank]
    G --> H[(Write nt_record_submissions)]
    H --> I[Admin reads pending queue in same browser storage]
    I --> J{Admin decision}
    J -- Return --> K[Save reason and Returned status]
    J -- Approve --> L[Save Approved status]
    K --> M[Teacher syncs status on next view]
    L --> M
    E --> N([Draft ends])
    M --> O([Review cycle ends])
